WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.254
Welcome to IELTS Platform.

00:00:02.404 --> 00:00:07.392
To begin, choose Create account and enter
your name, email address, and a password of

00:00:07.392 --> 00:00:08.917
at least eight characters.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.796
Confirm your password, then create your
account.

00:00:11.946 --> 00:00:13.109
Already registered?

00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:14.465
Choose Log in instead.

00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:19.129
Your dashboard shows your completed mocks,
average estimated band scores, and

00:00:19.129 --> 00:00:20.830
remaining practice allowance.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.535
Use the navigation to open Mocks, AI
practice, or Flashcards.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.343
Open Mocks and filter the library by
Reading or Listening.

00:00:29.493 --> 00:00:31.651
Choose Start mock on an available test.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:34.816
In Reading, read the passage and answer its
questions.

00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:39.718
In Listening, choose Start audio: you have
twenty seconds to read before playback

00:00:39.718 --> 00:00:40.129
begins.

00:00:40.279 --> 00:00:44.532
Use Previous, Next, or the numbered
question buttons to move around.

00:00:44.682 --> 00:00:49.038
At the final section, choose Submit mock
and confirm to see your score and answer

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:49.414
review.

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:54.924
During a Reading or Listening mock, select
text in a passage or question, then choose

00:00:54.924 --> 00:00:56.053
Highlight selection.

00:00:56.203 --> 00:00:59.893
Choose Add selection to notes to keep the
text with your own reminders.

00:01:00.043 --> 00:01:01.952
Open Notes to write or review them.

00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:07.253
Answers, notes, highlights, and your
current section save in this browser when
storage

00:01:07.253 --> 00:01:08.032
is available.

00:01:08.182 --> 00:01:12.981
Use Exit to leave; return on the same
device and browser to continue your saved
work.

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:17.366
Open AI practice and select an available
Speaking or Writing mock.

00:01:17.516 --> 00:01:20.524
For Speaking, allow microphone access when
asked.

00:01:20.674 --> 00:01:25.668
Listen to the question, choose Start
recording, speak naturally, then choose
Stop

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:26.100
answer.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.897
Continue through the questions to receive
feedback.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:33.390
For Writing, read the task, write your
essay, and choose Check with AI.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.869
Read the feedback and suggested
improvements.

00:01:36.019 --> 00:01:40.602
AI band estimates are for practice, not
official IELTS results.

00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:44.886
Open Flashcards to build your personal
vocabulary collection.

00:01:45.036 --> 00:01:49.908
Enter a word or phrase, its meaning or
translation, and an optional example, then

00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:50.931
choose Save word.

00:01:51.081 --> 00:01:56.129
Choose Study flashcards, try to recall each
meaning, and select the card to reveal it.

00:01:56.279 --> 00:01:59.232
Use Next card or Shuffle cards to keep
practicing.

00:01:59.382 --> 00:02:03.920
Save at least two words with different
meanings to unlock a multiple choice quiz,
then

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.503
review your answers and score.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:10.314
Use the sun or moon button in the header to
switch between light and dark mode,

00:02:10.314 --> 00:02:11.548
including during a mock.

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:15.011
Your choice is remembered in this browser
when storage is available.

00:02:15.161 --> 00:02:20.108
After submitting practice, return to
Dashboard to check your average scores and
recent

00:02:20.108 --> 00:02:20.568
results.

00:02:20.718 --> 00:02:23.625
Vocabulary quiz results stay in Flashcards.

00:02:23.775 --> 00:02:28.194
Choose one area to improve, practice a
little regularly, and return to this guide

00:02:28.194 --> 00:02:29.775
whenever you need a reminder.
